speech_material.output_shape:
Return only JSON matching this shape:
{
  "findings": [
    {
      "category": "mispronunciation",
      "time_range": "1.2-1.8",
      "issue": "brief description of the audible discrepancy",
      "severity": 2,
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "is_truncation": false
    }
  ]
}
Use approximate start-end seconds relative to this clip for time_range, or null if it cannot be localized reliably. Use an integer severity of 1, 2, or 3 and a numeric confidence from 0 to 1. Use a JSON boolean (true or false) for is_truncation on every finding. Use one of the listed fidelity categories, or clip_truncation when a cutoff itself is the finding. Return an empty findings list when there is no clear discrepancy. Do not add other fields.
